WEBVTT


00:00:35.527 --> 00:00:38.827
Mετάφραση εξ ακοής
* Remedy + agapaki *


00:00:43.827 --> 00:00:53.827
<i><b>1 tequila,2 tequila,3 tequila, FLOOR...
